---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { archiveBranches, archivePlannedTotal } from '../../data/archive';
import { site } from '../../config/site';

const featuredSeries = [
  { year: '1956—', eyebrow: 'BALLON D’OR', title: '발롱도르 역대 수상자', note: '연도별 인물·득표·시대적 배경' },
  { year: '1916—', eyebrow: 'COPA AMÉRICA', title: '코파 아메리카 최우수 선수', note: '대회별 수상 기록과 원전 대조' },
  { year: '1955—', eyebrow: 'EUROPEAN CUP', title: '유러피언컵 결승전', note: 'UEFA 챔피언스 리그 이전의 기록' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="삥이 아카이브"
  description={`축구의 인물과 대회, 수상 기록을 공식 명칭과 시대 구분에 따라 축적하는 ${site.name}의 아카이브입니다.`}
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: '홈', href: '/' }, { label: '삥이 아카이브', href: '/archive/' }]}
>
  <div class="archive-page">
    <section class="archive-hero">
      <div class="archive-kicker"><span>BBINGE ARCHIVE</span><span>EST. 2000s</span></div>
      <div class="archive-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="archive-label">삥이FC 기록총서</p>
          <h1>삥이<br />아카이브</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="archive-intro">
          <p>선수와 리그, 국제 대회와 시상 기록을 단편적인 정보가 아니라 서로 이어지는 축구사의 일부로 정리합니다.</p>
          <p>대회·기관·시상 명칭은 당대의 공식 명칭을 우선하며, 후대의 통칭으로 소급해 표기하지 않습니다.</p>
          <div class="archive-stat">
            <strong>{archivePlannedTotal}</strong>
            <span>기존 원고<br />이관 예정</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="archive-rule"><span>PERSON</span><span>COMPETITION</span><span>YEAR</span><span>RECORD</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="archive-directory" aria-labelledby="directory-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p>ARCHIVE DIRECTORY</p><h2 id="directory-title">기록 분류</h2></div>
        <p>현재 보이는 숫자는 네이버 블로그에 축적된 기존 원고의 이관 예정 규모입니다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="directory-list">
        {archiveBranches.map((branch) => (
          <article class="directory-row" id={branch.id}>
            <div class="directory-number">{branch.number}</div>
            <div class="directory-main">
              <p>{branch.originalTitle}</p>
              <h3>{branch.title}</h3>
              <p class="directory-description">{branch.description}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="directory-indexes">
              {branch.indexes.map((index) => <span>{index}</span>)}
            </div>
            <div class="directory-count"><strong>{branch.plannedCount}</strong><span>편 이관 예정</span></div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="archive-series" aria-labelledby="series-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p>SERIAL ARCHIVES</p><h2 id="series-title">대표 연재</h2></div>
        <p>연도와 대회의 계보를 따라 이어지는 장기 기록물입니다.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="series-grid">
        {featuredSeries.map((series, index) => (
          <article class="series-card">
            <div class="series-visual" aria-hidden="true">
              <span>{series.eyebrow}</span><strong>{series.year}</strong><i>0{index + 1}</i>
            </div>
            <div class="series-copy"><p>{series.eyebrow}</p><h3>{series.title}</h3><span>{series.note}</span></div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="archive-notice">
        <p>ARCHIVE IN PROGRESS</p>
        <div><strong>기록은 순차적으로 이관됩니다.</strong><span>원문 검토, 출처 재확인, 이미지 정비를 마친 글부터 공개합니다.</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .archive-page { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 0; }
  .archive-hero { border-top: 2px solid var(--bbfc-ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbfc-border); }
  .archive-kicker, .archive-rule { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .archive-kicker { padding: 10px 0 20px; }
  .archive-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; gap: 72px; align-items: end; padding: 24px 0 42px; }
  .archive-label, .section-heading > div > p { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--bbfc-blue); }
  .archive-hero h1 { margin-top: 12px; font-size: clamp(56px, 8vw, 92px); line-height: .86; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.075em; }
  .archive-intro { padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .archive-intro > p { max-width: 430px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--bbfc-ink-2); }
  .archive-intro > p + p { margin-top: 12px; }
  .archive-stat { display: flex; align-items: end; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--bbfc-border); }
  .archive-stat strong { font-size: 42px; line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .archive-stat span { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .archive-rule { padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--bbfc-line); }
  .archive-directory, .archive-series { padding-top: 64px; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; padding-bottom: 17px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bbfc-ink); }
  .section-heading h2 { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .section-heading > p { max-width: 360px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: right; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .directory-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 54px 1.2fr 1.3fr 80px; gap: 20px; align-items: start; padding: 24px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbfc-border); }
  .directory-number { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--bbfc-blue); }
  .directory-main > p:first-child, .series-copy > p { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .13em; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .directory-main h3 { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 620; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .directory-description { margin-top: 9px; max-width: 330px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--bbfc-gray-1); }
  .directory-indexes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .directory-indexes span { padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid var(--bbfc-border); border-radius: 99px; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--bbfc-ink-2); }
  .directory-count { text-align: right; }
  .directory-count strong { display: block; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; }
  .directory-count span { display: block; margin-top: 5px; font-size: 9px; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .series-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; padding-top: 20px; }
  .series-card { border: 1px solid var(--bbfc-border); border-radius: var(--bbfc-radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .series-visual { position: relative; display: flex; min-height: 210px; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px; background: var(--bbfc-ink); color: white; overflow: hidden; }
  .series-visual::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 180px; height: 180px; right: -55px; bottom: -65px; border: 24px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 50%; }
  .series-visual span { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .18em; opacity: .65; }
  .series-visual strong { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: 45px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  .series-visual i { position: absolute; right: 16px; top: 14px; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; opacity: .07; }
  .series-copy { padding: 16px; }
  .series-copy h3 { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .series-copy > span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .archive-notice { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 42px; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--bbfc-ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbfc-border); }
  .archive-notice > p { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--bbfc-blue); }
  .archive-notice div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
  .archive-notice strong { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .archive-notice span { font-size: 11px; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .archive-page { padding: 20px 16px 0; }
    .archive-kicker { padding-bottom: 8px; }
    .archive-hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 34px; padding: 25px 0 30px; }
    .archive-hero h1 { font-size: 59px; }
    .archive-stat { margin-top: 22px; }
    .archive-rule span:nth-child(2), .archive-rule span:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
    .archive-directory, .archive-series { padding-top: 48px; }
    .section-heading { display: block; }
    .section-heading > p { margin-top: 10px; text-align: left; }
    .directory-row { grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr auto; gap: 10px; padding: 22px 0; }
    .directory-indexes { grid-column: 2 / 4; }
    .directory-count { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
    .directory-description { padding-right: 8px; }
    .series-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .series-visual { min-height: 175px; }
    .archive-notice { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .archive-notice div { display: grid; gap: 7px; }
  }
</style>
